	(text "J7: 40-PIN 0.5mm FPC (EVKB J48, Wuerth 68714014022)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "179439d9-d31b-4160-bfd4-fd6786b7bc20")
	)
	(text "MIPI DSI LCD + TOUCH: Rocktech RK055HDMIPI4MA0 (RK055MHD091A0-CTG 720x1280 HX8394, GT911 CTP) on a 40-pin 0.5mm FPC - replica of MIMXRT1170-EVKB J48"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2db7b709-ca4b-48b1-bdd2-618e5ef57b9e")
	)
	(text "MIPI DSI: 2 data lanes + clock straight from U1 (A8/B8, A10/B10, A9/B9). 100R differential pairs, length-matched, no stubs; lanes 2/3 unused on the RT1176 (EVKB test resistors omitted)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "384aeef7-b7ed-44ab-9d0d-27855c4cf9de")
	)
	(text "touch I2C = LPI2C5 (GPIO_LPSR_04/05), TE GPIO_AD_05. GT911 touch I2C 7-bit address 0x5D or 0x14 (EVKB note: 0xBA/0xBB or 0x28/0x29 as 8-bit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3ee991ac-aa53-4b57-8a30-2b4ab515936b")
	)
	(text "LCD_TE: the tearing-effect output is 1.8V logic; the EVKB shifts it to 3.3V with U355 (74AVC8T245). Not used by the driver (DSI video mode), so R67 is DNP - add a shifter if TE is ever needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ba6151b-2c8c-4642-83bb-d8aff42764a8")
	)
	(text "CTP I2C on LPI2C5 with 2.2k pull-ups to +3V3 (EVKB: two 4.7k pairs in parallel, R1026/R1027 + R1323/R1324) (NVCC_LPSR = 3.3V on both boards). LCM_PWR_EN 10k pull-up to +3V3 (EVKB R1825); R67/R64/R72/R76/R77 are the EVKB 0R isolation links."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "52431a74-2937-4ae8-a432-94d200e2dae9")
	)
	(text "CONTROL LINES  (EVKB R405/R847, R848/R1825, R1849+D32, R414, R1026/R1027, R2031/R2032)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76b737ae-a061-4b44-aca8-1c8108b29fdb")
	)
	(text "RAIL LINKS  (EVKB R1827/R1826/R846)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8903707c-755f-4677-b816-7b552f5b93f3")
	)
	(text "LCD_RST: GPIO_AD_02 (3.3V) drives the 1.8V LRSTB input through D9 with a 10k pull-up to +1V8 (EVKB R1849/D32): open-drain style level translation, no shifter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.17 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a10ea242-11d2-4b5f-944b-b75e7725c7a4")
	)
	(text "Pins 1/2 (LEDK/LEDA) and 23 (2.8V) are not driven - leave the adapter jumpers J5/J3 and J6 at their default 1-2 (on-board boost / LDO). 1.8V and 3.3V are still fed (pins 25/30) for the J8/J7 2-3 option."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d29095b2-0452-4edc-b432-a5d9b3b8fd86")
	)
	(text "GPIO map (NXP board.h / MipiDisplay panel_gpio.h): LCD reset GPIO_AD_02, backlight GPIO_AD_30, panel power GPIO_DISP_B2_15, touch INT GPIO_AD_00, touch RST GPIO_AD_01,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eaa2788b-650a-41b0-abe9-c1b38bf5b88c")
	)
	(text "Pins 39/40: 5V main supply of the RK055HDMIPI4MA0 adapter, gated on the adapter by LCM_PWR_EN (pin 32). Pin 34 = BACKLIGHT_CTL enables/dims the adapter's own LED boost (SPF-39012 U1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fb0e7246-37b7-4716-adea-fccc3c3e9cc1")
	)
